# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# THIS REPOSITORY IS PUBLIC. NOTHING PATIENT-DERIVED GOES IN IT. EVER.
#
# Not the images, not the metrics, not the case identifiers, not screenshots
# of the viewer. This is a standing rule, not a temporary state: everything
# below regenerates from the pipeline against a local copy of the source data,
# so excluding it costs nothing. See docs/data-and-privacy.md.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Everything under work/ is patient-derived:
#   outputs/  denoised NIfTI volumes (~7.0 GB)
#   figures/  rendered axial CT slices
#   *.json    metrics and case lists keyed by MIHEART accession ID
work/

# Exported viewer slices (~420 MB), and the manifests that index them by case ID
viewer/slices/
viewer/manifest.json
viewer/metrics.json

# Run logs name each case as it is processed
logs/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Large third-party artifacts — fetched, not vendored. See docs/setup.md.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Model checkpoints (~2.4 GB), released by the original authors
weights/

# Python virtualenv (~279 MB) — rebuild from requirements.txt
envs/

# Upstream model source — cloned at pinned commits by scripts/clone_upstream.sh
repos/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Routine noise
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.DS_Store
*.swp
nohup.out

# Viewer screenshots show patient anatomy. Only figures that contain no
# patient material belong in docs/img/ — currently pipeline.svg and
# results.png (cohort means, no identifiers).
docs/img/viewer-*.png
docs/img/*screenshot*
docs/img/*MIHEART*
